                                "sense_id": "fb1fd00f-dbc9-3608-bf20-b50bf1bc4187",
                                "text": "[Peter W.] Smith's suicide occurred three days before the Mueller investigation began. Was he \"Epsteined\"?"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "810983bc-6007-4fd2-bbcf-9ecb79289ae7",
                                "sense_id": "fb1fd00f-dbc9-3608-bf20-b50bf1bc4187",
                                "text": "His [John McAfee's] prophecy about being \"Epsteined\", as some commentators are calling his death, was posted at the same time."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "0b3b43d9-00fb-4bdb-adf2-42039f4523e7",
                                "sense_id": "fb1fd00f-dbc9-3608-bf20-b50bf1bc4187",
                                "text": "After his [Sean \"Diddy\" Combs'] arrest on charges of sex trafficking, racketeering, and organizing drug-fueled sex parties, social media erupted with fears that Combs might be \"Epsteined.\""
                            }
                        ]
                    }
